          "format": 1,
          "rawSQL": "-- 절감액 = AI 예측 건수(7일) × 1건당 절감(120 만원 = 4h × ₩300,000 / 10,000)\nSELECT COUNT(*) * 120 AS \"이번 주 AI 예방 절감액\"\nFROM robot_telemetry_db.gold_robot_daily_stats\nWHERE dt >= CAST(CAST(current_timestamp AT TIME ZONE 'Asia/Seoul' AS DATE) - INTERVAL '7' DAY AS DATE)\n  AND dt <  CAST(current_timestamp AT TIME ZONE 'Asia/Seoul' AS DATE)\n  AND dominant_failure_type IS NOT NULL\n  AND dominant_failure_type <> 'NONE'",
          "refId": "A",
          "table": "gold_robot_daily_stats"
        }
      ],
      "title": "이번 주 AI 예방 절감액 (만원, 7일)",
      "type": "stat"
